  maxHealth: 180
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 3000
  description: The old king of the endless host. The crown floats now - three reigns,
    each crueller than the last, and the head under it gave out before the ambition
    did.
  tactics: Three phases stacking cross-quads, dense rings, and spirals. Phase entries
    are pulsed and tinted - the moment it flashes, reposition to open space before
    the new pattern's first volley. The dense ring's gaps are narrow but honest;
    the spiral rewards circling with it.
